  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPU - HR officer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IPU - MR tj&#xe4;nst</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projektet omfattar finansiering av en post p&#xe5; IPUs huvudkvarter i Genhve f&#xf6;r att arbeta med MR-fr&#xe5;gor under en tre&#xe5;rsperiod. Norad samfinansierar projektet med 1/3 och IPU svarar f&#xf6;r resterande tredje-del. Efter projektets slut kommer IPU att ta &#xf6;ver hela finansieringen av tj&#xe4;nsten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The project comprises the employment of a programme officer for human rights issues to be stationed at IPU headquarters in Genhve. Norad is expected to cofinance the project with one third of the costs and IPU will assume the remaining. After the end of the project, which is threyears, IPU will assume the total financing of the post.</narrative>
  </description>
